185 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In the realm of home automation and smart technology, there is an increasing demand for intuitive, hands-free control systems that simplify daily tasks and enhance convenience. One of the most common functions in a household or office setting is lighting control, which traditionally requires manual switches or remote devices. However, these methods may not always be convenient, especially in situations where individuals have their hands full or when accessibility is a concern. To address this, the concept of sound-activated systems has gained popularity, providing an innovative way to control devices using simple auditory cues. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
