/E (Arduino Microcontroller: The Arduino board serves as the "brain" of the system. It processes the input from the sound sensor, applies any necessary logic \(such as threshold detection\), and controls the relay to activate the light. The Arduino compares the received signal with a predefined threshold value. If the detected sound is above the threshold, the microcontroller sends a signal to the relay to )
