/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (3\) Relay Module : The relay module acts as an electrical switch controlled by the  Arduino. It enables the microcontroller to control high-voltage devices, such as  lights, without directly handling high currents. When activated by the Arduino, the  relay allows current to flow through the light's circuit. )
